{"unit_id":"AKS1st__dsh-skill-manager#card-zh","repo":"AKS1st/dsh-skill-manager","commit":"fb452031031ea50a3287292d22b54e765d1039dc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-skill-manager**（DSH Web 插件）：在 Web 设置面板中集中浏览和管理 DSH 可见的技能。它在设置页注册技能目录，并由服务端读取分层技能注册表，通过文件树与读写接口连接浏览器界面。主要功能包括按系统、用户、工作区、预设和插件来源查看技能，浏览和编辑技能文件，导入或导出 ZIP，以及启用、停用和删除可写技能。适合希望在图形界面整理技能、检查 SKILL.md 或在工作区间迁移技能的 DSH 用户。系统技能为只读；无需额外账号或 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:80-87","src/index.ts:632-677","src/index.ts:919-956","src/index.ts:959-1080"]}
{"unit_id":"AKS1st__dsh-skill-manager#card-en","repo":"AKS1st/dsh-skill-manager","commit":"fb452031031ea50a3287292d22b54e765d1039dc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-manager is a DSH web settings plugin for organizing skills. It groups the catalog by source, displays file trees, and supports editing, ZIP import and export, and enabling, disabling, or deleting writable skills. System skills are read-only. Organize skills across workspaces.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:80-87","src/index.ts:632-677","src/index.ts:919-956","src/index.ts:959-1080"]}
